// The Icefall: snow, and ice that does not hold.
//  - The frozen pond in the middle is a crust over a hollow: break the ice under an enemy and it
//    drops into a hole it cannot climb out of (a player jumps out). A floe cut loose sinks a step.
//  - A frost cap in each corner: a wide slab of ice on a thin stem. Break the stem and the cap
//    comes down on everything under it.
//  - Two stone arches with icicles over the paths to the pond: volt both legs of one to bring it
//    down on whoever is passing under.
